    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The gameplay shown is from an early stage of development.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Umbra's Cauldron</strong> is a 2D card-stacking game in which you take on the role of an alchemist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Had I mixed a <strong>bloodroot</strong> or a drop of <strong>honey</strong> into my tincture? Oh well, it'll all go <strong>wrong</strong>... Or at least that's what you thought. Now you find yourself as a <strong>book</strong> in a <strong>magical world</strong>, trying to regain your original form with the help of powerful <strong>potions</strong> and lots of <strong>unexplored</strong> recipes. But don't worry, you're not alone. Crawly critters will be by your side on your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you be able to discover all the <strong>card</strong>, fill your empty <strong>pages</strong> and transform back?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Stack Cards</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Draw, stack and combine cards to collect resources, discover recipes and brew unique potions. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3118490/extras/dc37363fc45dca9fb151b9b0cff37f8a.poster.avif?t=1746698824\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3118490/extras/dc37363fc45dca9fb151b9b0cff37f8a.webm?t=1746698824\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3118490/extras/dc37363fc45dca9fb151b9b0cff37f8a.mp4?t=1746698824\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Living Book</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have turned into a book. All the cards you discover and recipes you find are written down on your pages. If you fill your empty pages completely, you might find a way to turn back.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong> </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Everything is a card</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Beautiful illustrations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Countless recipes to discover and explore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crawling bugs</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3118490/extras/b76cdb87b211e63e010f9af069143653.poster.avif?t=1746698824\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3118490/extras/b76cdb87b211e63e010f9af069143653.webm?t=1746698824\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3118490/extras/b76cdb87b211e63e010f9af069143653.mp4?t=1746698824\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The gameplay shown is from an early stage of development.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Umbra's Cauldron</strong> is a 2D card-stacking game in which you take on the role of an alchemist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Had I mixed a <strong>bloodroot</strong> or a drop of <strong>honey</strong> into my tincture? Oh well, it'll all go <strong>wrong</strong>... Or at least that's what you thought. Now you find yourself as a <strong>book</strong> in a <strong>magical world</strong>, trying to regain your original form with the help of powerful <strong>potions</strong> and lots of <strong>unexplored</strong> recipes. But don't worry, you're not alone. Crawly critters will be by your side on your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you be able to discover all the <strong>card</strong>, fill your empty <strong>pages</strong> and transform back?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Stack Cards</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Draw, stack and combine cards to collect resources, discover recipes and brew unique potions. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3118490/extras/dc37363fc45dca9fb151b9b0cff37f8a.poster.avif?t=1746698824\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3118490/extras/dc37363fc45dca9fb151b9b0cff37f8a.webm?t=1746698824\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3118490/extras/dc37363fc45dca9fb151b9b0cff37f8a.mp4?t=1746698824\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Living Book</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have turned into a book. All the cards you discover and recipes you find are written down on your pages. If you fill your empty pages completely, you might find a way to turn back.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong> </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Everything is a card</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Beautiful illustrations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Countless recipes to discover and explore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crawling bugs</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3118490/extras/b76cdb87b211e63e010f9af069143653.poster.avif?t=1746698824\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3118490/extras/b76cdb87b211e63e010f9af069143653.webm?t=1746698824\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3118490/extras/b76cdb87b211e63e010f9af069143653.mp4?t=1746698824\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Umbra's Cauldron is a 2D card-stacking game in which every element of the game is a card. You have turned into a book and are now looking for a way to get back to your original form. Combine cards, discover recipes and fill your blank pages with knowledge.",
